{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1642291200, "end_date": 1642982399, "month_true_total": 1652, "quota": 15, "returned": 15, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:48:29 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "108649219", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971263190", "personaname": "Garvin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971263190/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 690, "last_played": 1635385182, "avatar": "7a4c8299bbcbf726d38455da3139eb5b8c5af2f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very bad 0/10.  The \"from the l4d creator\" bit they run at you is just shameful.  Those really great physics from L4D like stumbling bleeding zombies after you shoot them or an arm or left blowing off were just the kind of details that made it a great game.  Some of the graphics are better and the are guns that are more fun to use.  You can't just use your favorite gun though w/o buying annoying upgrades.  Some of the game cards are just damn irritating, also as an epic failure there is no campaign VS mode.", "timestamp_created": 1642979246, "timestamp_updated": 1642979246, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493901312351226807", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108647501", "author": {"steamid": "76561199134736299", "personaname": "noy89kt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199134736299/", "num_games_owned": 148, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 1382, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 283, "playtime_at_review": 301, "last_played": 1787788896, "avatar": "8d64e207debeb76be88cf4b05f44a1f2f1929e5f"}, "language": "english", "review": "its a ♥♥♥♥♥♥ remake of l4d but its ight", "timestamp_created": 1642976921, "timestamp_updated": 1642976921, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490324586629867554", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108645127", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041432968", "personaname": "parenthetical", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/parenthetical/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 8858, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6801, "last_played": 1697825141, "avatar": "9130744dcfd7cc3f3fc4cfff50145aff87355b11"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lot of fun once you get into it. Gunplay feels phenomenal. Recent balance changes have almost universally improved the game, haven't really gotten bored with the nearly infinite card combinations.", "timestamp_created": 1642974092, "timestamp_updated": 1642974092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496061027050018311", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108644747", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063984604", "personaname": "Ada❤Kennedy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DeppChan11/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 584, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 584, "last_played": 1642973496, "avatar": "e123051ffc4f07e73737d58c17e3bee71366fc34"}, "language": "english", "review": "The lack of continues are ridiculous...You could at least made it so the team could buy an extra continue with coppers.", "timestamp_created": 1642973658, "timestamp_updated": 1642973658, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530777931213378906", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108644604", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975264038", "personaname": "Cap'N Cook", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Hanzkazan/", "num_games_owned": 606, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 7522, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4592, "last_played": 1773608140, "avatar": "60cf003af7b8498e2493b101874f60e38851387e"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you put all the negative people aside that go: \"They log your chat and voice\"\nBecause those people who commented that; will ofcourse not have a Facebook, Smartphone, SmartTV or Xbox Kinect in they're house / possesion ;)\n\nIf you have doubts about the game, def get it on sale, even tho I do think it's worth the price it is now, specially with them bringing out more DLC's and such!\n\nThis game is pretty amazing, lot of different builds, replay ability is huge, the difference in difficulty is also pretty well done.\nAlso with the christmas event, they had christmas cosmetics, so would assume / hope that they do that with other festivalseasons as well :) \n\nIt's more fun to play with friends, because rando's either are looting everything, or they just die to the most easy stuff", "timestamp_created": 1642973491, "timestamp_updated": 1642973491, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534246563911437988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108642800", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983383923", "personaname": "Zold", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zo1d/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1533, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1501, "last_played": 1687035588, "avatar": "a84047e12aa1c9ed946142c1c7405f09cf49fc1f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Like Polygon said - Back 4 Blood is more than just Left 4 Dead. Yep, its worse version of it.\nFrom the 7 of 150 creators of L4D, also known as \"creators of Evolve\".", "timestamp_created": 1642971505, "timestamp_updated": 1642971505, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510740220546722412", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108641065", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961116953", "personaname": "Budgie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961116953/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 43371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16160, "last_played": 1727381223, "avatar": "4132825aa702723569ae7995fc35eca3322d7a81"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good enjoyable zombie co-op shooter. Its no L4D by any means but it has its own perks.\nThe gun models and gun sounds are excellent, the graphics are good enough, the cross play can be annoying when you get very low class players.\n\nThe card build packs do make for a more dynamic game. Build you card pack for how you want to play the game, to focus on melee or to just spray bullets\n\nThe game does maintain a little of the sneak past and be quiet otherwise expect pain element to it but when you get used to the game and end up playing on recruit level just for fun as its difficult to find a good team you can find yourself causing the hords for a little more fun.\n\nOne little drawback is that some of the larger zombies feel like bullet sponges and like any modern game with console design in mind it just doesn't have the quality of a PC only first person shooter.\n\nI miss the samurai sword and just cannot get into the vs mode at all.", "timestamp_created": 1642969673, "timestamp_updated": 1642969673, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501266598701477051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108639608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198343867101", "personaname": "Femboi Kitten", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198343867101/", "num_games_owned": 346, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5950, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3381, "last_played": 1760494994, "avatar": "d84d56b37bb698158830696b3bef366e16777271"}, "language": "english", "review": ".", "timestamp_created": 1642968211, "timestamp_updated": 1642968211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108638533", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001607016", "personaname": "Sabin787", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001607016/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 6323, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6082, "last_played": 1721100031, "avatar": "50520e5314e12c57f8440597ac2c068ca